{"url": "https://x.com/farzyness/status/2106592372150632793", "id": "2106592372150632793", "text": "This video was 100% autonomously created with my Grok @bot called 'Video Creator': https://x.ai/bot/RPtsHesZPgAlwMOZAX8Ef\n\nAll I did was give it the idea, and it autonomously created the animations, found the clips, researched, scripted, edited, outlined, and everything in between.\n\nThe bot will auto-hatch helper bots that it uses to delegate tasks so that the creation process is as efficient and as quick as possible.\n\nIt will tailor itself to your style, and will connect to whatever sources you want to generate the videos, voice, animations, scripts, etc.\n\nOr you can choose default settings and it'll figure out the best way to generate videos based on what you have access to.\n\nEnjoy!", "raw_text": {"text": "This video was 100% autonomously created with my Grok @bot called 'Video Creator': https://t.co/KPXeMEFxJo\n\nAll I did was give it the idea, and it autonomously created the animations, found the clips, researched, scripted, edited, outlined, and everything in between.\n\nThe bot will auto-hatch helper bots that it uses to delegate tasks so that the creation process is as efficient and as quick as possible.\n\nIt will tailor itself to your style, and will connect to whatever sources you want to generate the videos, voice, animations, scripts, etc.\n\nOr you can choose default settings and it'll figure out the best way to generate videos based on what you have access to.\n\nEnjoy!", "display_text_range": [0, 678], "facets": [{"type": "mention", "indices": [54, 58], "original": "bot", "id": "2085838061347217408"}, {"type": "url", "indices": [83, 106], "original": "https://t.co/KPXeMEFxJo", "replacement": "https://x.ai/bot/RPtsHesZPgAlwMOZAX8Ef", "display": "x.ai/bot/RPtsHesZPg\u2026"}]}, "author": {"screen_name": "farzyness", "url": "https://x.com/farzyness", "id": "17862108", "followers": 395722, "following": 1864, "likes": 106822, "media_count": 6990, "n